.com> 1789995828 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789995828 +0300\n\nchore: raise the scaffold React development minimum to 18.3.1 (#33)\n\nSet the generated React and React DOM development ranges to ^18.3.1 while keeping the 18.x peers unchanged. This aligns new projects with the React 18 bridge runtime without requiring React 19.\n\nCover the generated ranges for Rspack, Webpack and monorepo packages. Keep the lint guard out of the scaffold so the shared ESLint config owns it.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsSs0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOzsQABf4aZFuwJ7oyTqANQ7DC3++\nZsGAUPmcR5dItXQva5O9/RAziYl5JvF31SqZ3RVoSlpVhL/N4rTDrVrUSH9q0+8G\n8ySzKt1+4RogFTwaZMSM0BRhyDiqSxjntz5AguFQK0ArWD/vL7xHRaROg72D9MAl\nFQt8AHO68Xf4avw6SlSV4w6tbmTJXcKBOsy1ozLuWRaBRB1yIcF/KlJKd8eJJfor\n0M8Vyeb4l8LJdfPH5EbD/0Cmc8jawyNIAbC0rvtXQZqpXsNJBCRPGkpb5nV09hXP\nfVlvwieR5Q3eTAknSIXyOZ3VmvrVf1u6vBIOTDevdcFiqIV9Xy8HS65P0hKt5w2X\n+Ftu54RqMt2dvLzPcUIkRDOwdGEWqNz8DDfxHzbzaRbvN7Cj3Mt+IAHuOwStDc2m\ny223y4hH4SqeeHcD6OwmdcY7PMiVbUx6e3VK1uNhL08qBffjU9RtTwnE71PemPaR\n+aHvcVUNKKKbRy4lyzcVjFMUSNPtgdG2uCRfCKRDlOM20XBAwz7SfSwie3d0tYMC\nxtgOe78Lxk0M3y/Ax9vIVlMc6RDsxZbuaFsFDqPyofQF3cJQsHshDI1d6NfnsOM9\n6QafTrtgSyaEA6l9+0YrUdSuEenQxK+E+8sNw+U1t38Y1J6pksBx/jlnGKP1K5xy\nwkl9e0/VsuBsozfRHl64\n=hAH6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T13:03:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/create-o3-app/commit/a9476bb697f7ccce9266d16cd0678f2279a4a1ce","node_id":"C_kwDOQz_jx9oAKGE5NDc2YmI2OTdmN2NjY2U5MjY2ZDE2Y2QwNjc4ZjIyNzlhNGExY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/create-o3-app/commit/f52bb641bce7be8e388e7157d4cbfef49d9880a0","sha":"f52bb641bce7be8e388e7157d4cbfef49d9880a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/f52bb641bce7be8e388e7157d4cbfef49d9880a0"}],"sha":"a9476bb697f7ccce9266d16cd0678f2279a4a1ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/a9476bb697f7ccce9266d16cd0678f2279a4a1ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52504170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ibacher","id":52504170,"login":"ibacher","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTA0MTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ibacher","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/f52bb641bce7be8e388e7157d4cbfef49d9880a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T16:43:14Z","email":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T16:43:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(chore) Upgrade to SWR 2.5.1 (#32)\n\n* chore: clear mocks through the shared vitest config (#29)\n\nEvery test file repeated a beforeEach that only called vi.clearAllMocks,\nwhich is what clearMocks does for free. The config we scaffold for\ngenerated apps already sets it, so the generator was holding its own\ntests to a different standard than the ones it writes.\n\nConfirmed the config carries the behaviour rather than the tests passing\nby luck: dropping clearMocks fails six tests across standalone.test.ts\nand logger.test.ts.\n\n* (chore) Upgrade to SWR 2.5.1","tree":{"sha":"d377e0f9328d4d84f0e1db1c0efd4209e341ff5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/trees/d377e0f9328d4d84f0e1db1c0efd4209e341ff5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/commits/f52bb641bce7be8e388e7157d4cbfef49d9880a0","verification":{"payload":"tree d377e0f9328d4d84f0e1db1c0efd4209e341ff5d\nparent 0d1a432003c9ba9c228eefecfceb0f53c9dda1a3\nauthor Ian <52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com> 1789836194 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789836194 +0300\n\n(chore) Upgrade to SWR 2.5.1 (#32)\n\n* chore: clear mocks through the shared vitest config (#29)\n\nEvery test file repeated a beforeEach that only called vi.clearAllMocks,\nwhich is what clearMocks does for free. The config we scaffold for\ngenerated apps already sets it, so the generator was holding its own\ntests to a different standard than the ones it writes.\n\nConfirmed the config carries the behaviour rather than the tests passing\nby luck: dropping clearMocks fails six tests across standalone.test.ts\nand logger.test.ts.\n\n* (chore) Upgrade to SWR 2.5.1","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFc