sts to a different standard than the ones it writes.\n\nConfirmed the config carries the behaviour rather than the tests passing\nby luck: dropping clearMocks fails six tests across standalone.test.ts\nand logger.test.ts.","tree":{"sha":"87a4bc53a74297757f3620735b9ccbc6be0053a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/trees/87a4bc53a74297757f3620735b9ccbc6be0053a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/commits/0d1a432003c9ba9c228eefecfceb0f53c9dda1a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 87a4bc53a74297757f3620735b9ccbc6be0053a0\nparent cd35129af23576b4666122e777a8e1e1dc12ffec\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1786703517 +0300\ncommitter Ian <ian.c.bacher@gmail.com> 1789830389 -0400\n\nchore: clear mocks through the shared vitest config (#29)\n\nEvery test file repeated a beforeEach that only called vi.clearAllMocks,\nwhich is what clearMocks does for free. The config we scaffold for\ngenerated apps already sets it, so the generator was holding its own\ntests to a different standard than the ones it writes.\n\nConfirmed the config carries the behaviour rather than the tests passing\nby luck: dropping clearMocks fails six tests across standalone.test.ts\nand logger.test.ts.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEEiBRjXRBKNjoNGYyK7kAdMEMSmhAFAmqupPwACgkQ7kAdMEMS\nmhCRzA//eBzG6BgTL1/dqNXifq4zE/2CXInValSmLDbtGBBgHEk55j5RFpArvn+h\n+arVBWUQJjvsL61BR9dNhb/8LOZtLfKkQFWOsCw9m/owOiRbkQatI0Gpr57SO3ZD\n8ynOffvrVhlDfIkYm84n3e29UnPuO6mKELsjymUktwKD6ZvYNwX2xwgwqBdHAaav\nV3NhBxdTDlMHx43O8W9vlTRRebSQEA/rRKEmOpsmxvkLKlWGYAGW0Bgen4WhMMLE\nsoSu8KqDEqQnfDnThnt1uqP6ksAMoo11m8PIhrZy4qdjWw6gxXlDFT1766x0y0Dr\n6oLDYOcRJeTCgPuCR81szc9nZkyHAYn1CaoX0AXtGHG9VkEUqeCExNy+bDfn1pYC\nntqv3zjQLpDKvAEeZQkXAPKTsxNnzfGTUc2jkvyez11c73Ct7hVw3sAyrNEeDIKU\nRfZYtRFCg0GKShq2itYC9XDjzcVX4JllrHOq5Omz5TEuEEbzyQWZyLt0EnPUQEvI\nWEBmwAYlqkQf5wpicNpW/Su7q8xc7Xg8wb/P74wLJHEbsKo8z9rOBYjPgiBGGxCs\nL4LF1rKIPjQphO1aVrt2r7nB6PFPw7g