skigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/cd35129af23576b4666122e777a8e1e1dc12ffec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T10:30:50Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T10:30:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: add CI scripts to new monorepo roots (#28)\n\n* fix: add CI scripts to new monorepo roots\n\n* Omit the package-level verify script from monorepo packages\n\nThe root now defines verify as a turbo run, so a package that also\ndefines its own chain gives a monorepo two ways to verify and the\npackage-level one bypasses turbo entirely.\n\nGate it the same way postinstall, husky, lint-staged and packageManager\nare already gated, and assert both variants in the template test.\n\n* Ignore the turbo cache and stop serializing the test task\n\nGenerating a turbo.json without ignoring .turbo left the cache in the\nworking tree: one verify run put 16 files, including a .tar.zst, in\nfront of git add.\n\nDrop dependsOn from the test task too. A package''s tests do not need its\ndependencies'' tests to have run, so the edge only serializes the graph.\npatient-chart''s test task has no dependsOn for the same reason, while\ntypescript keeps one because type checking does need upstream\ndeclarations.","tree":{"sha":"9a0089e25c4a5a56eed92ae0d0f1fa09fe5a46d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/trees/9a0089e25c4a5a56eed92ae0d0f1fa09fe5a46d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/commits/cd35129af23576b4666122e777a8e1e1dc12ffec","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a0089e25c4a5a56eed92ae0d0f1fa09fe5a46d9\nparent 9cffea591e3131629b93cafa85cbe254b2f261e8\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1786703450 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786703450 +0300\n\nfix: add CI scripts to new monorepo roots (#28)\n\n* fix: add CI scripts to new monorepo roots\n\n* Omit the package-level verify script from monorepo packages\n\nThe root now defines verify as a turbo run, so a package that also\ndefines its own chain gives a monorepo two ways to verify and the\npackage-level one bypasses turbo entirely.\n\nGate it the same way postinstall, husky, lint-staged and packageManager\nare already gated, and assert both variants in the template test.\n\n* Ignore the turbo cache and stop serializing the test task\n\nGenerating a turbo.json without ignoring .turbo left the cache in the\nworking tree: one verify run put 16 files, including a .tar.zst, in\nfront of git add.\n\nDrop dependsOn from the test task too. A package''s tests do not need its\ndependencies'' tests to have run, so the edge only serializes the graph.\npatient-chart''s test task has no dependsOn for the same reason, while\ntypescript keeps one because type checking does need upstream\ndeclarations.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfu5aCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/nQQAEyLwrQ9RH43zzi3WsR/NZnG\nPeG++RGAvBcxQX9G92W5z/XAoSY4E9GMcC8D6LhgG3pfTM2C6AawwHeskr5Lahhb\nZNR1fDGe0sMBnzDIJo8N4XpE/vi0uEFi/IKpPQHFwrr2R/kKi45ddVhbS4j4qHUq\neP64CTVqo7bIiXsldDwmBldDKMKJIBp44oH1EVRN1m62doCJxRLV243dGz0+RXfw\n3byKLJsauAz2QKMhW92g9ty0aY/adnjGvm9gMBqHC7sunp2w4qqtMppGpHyCkcmV\nLlLaEcg/0yOk