e-o3-app/commits/cd35129af23576b4666122e777a8e1e1dc12ffec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/9cffea591e3131629b93cafa85cbe254b2f261e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T21:38:42Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T21:38:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: add verify script to scaffolded apps (#26)\n\nAdd a `verify` script to generated app package.json files so the reusable OpenMRS CI workflow can run lint, type checks, and tests.\n\nThe reusable workflow at openmrs-contrib-gha-workflows resolves `verify_command` to `yarn verify` for a standalone module, so scaffolded apps failed that step outright. The script stops at tests rather than including a build, because the workflow already runs the build as its own step beforehand.\n\nAlso adds an integration test that validates the generated package.json includes the script.","tree":{"sha":"f7f85d18ea05e5af7b8f5269bc787df247266083","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/trees/f7f85d18ea05e5af7b8f5269bc787df247266083"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/commits/9cffea591e3131629b93cafa85cbe254b2f261e8","verification":{"payload":"tree f7f85d18ea05e5af7b8f5269bc787df247266083\nparent c4a63fe5a8d14f4336a157b8a8f12da0e2d96814\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1786657122 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786657122 +0300\n\nfix: add verify script to scaffolded apps (#26)\n\nAdd a `verify` script to generated app package.json files so the reusable OpenMRS CI workflow can run lint, type checks, and tests.\n\nThe reusable workflow at openmrs-contrib-gha-workflows resolves `verify_command` to `yarn verify` for a standalone module, so scaffolded apps failed that step outright. The script stops at tests rather than including a build, because the workflow already runs the build as its own step beforehand.\n\nAlso adds an integration test that validates the generated package.json includes the script.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqfjliCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWEQQAKAWW7mHmgntGQI3NEfNdzzI\ngyvdF5hpykujrAcdtftUqJMbKnmpMhdhpdBpRVzA/gzDy3EuwglKCzZZPWQrLLIz\nxJuYdM2/XK6udZMJ/OomDJig3hrA5fX9q0BVEAK9O28WXDLlVkq+r3C4FfLY+Gx3\n+VXEvx+mw4MhUL7/O1pe5MfndnDJSxe5NqntcJFXNqIo42DfqtR2Q68Ntw0Zrhv3\nC5xdSWbm/8V+wxyrrke5nujBUKtkTEQswAkyjrgw1/7y70Qm/w94DKCHsGx+kDUU\np5Zl3Yr/uWQjHTBu/aiio4ZVsacBG5JprTR+4ylpzs9T3cxj9WDg+zn4RVBE0Y3q\nPVkuwxYWaaxyi/XdS4t4rY3GcEDwYMYHqSGZZqYTCDogZXnEuVc7pOs350oEeM0F\nHEj43aWp57Wod2ch9J28Zs9aupe3awDQPnylxtrBMWCvfTMqWOnE/sJwHzJaUBPR\nSBUAIRh3omps56fP0RDqnWS8GbcA0JXth6JwSMR9rUdVpWH9m0O+oR63/FoNDFHx\nPJHdkrPsBmi52alUq5s+mglyFBqA1jfc9q4W5Da84Gqo7hO1DuNljGlI+DOT6Ztf\nk0AVsQ7VdhXRK93uJR7T8Kbkjpo1oksyDBopid/iIZhm+tAeXRMGXmeXuxwd+fje\nAACGVStmOMs9r5/m2UHG\n=cd9h\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T21:38:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":