gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/e1c2dba201ae119b04d04a44209058a0c0e9f208/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T22:59:34Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T22:59:34Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"message":"Make the rspack/webpack version conditional too\n\nThe previous fix swapped the shared version range from ^5.99.9 to\n^1.7.10, but that just moved the bug: now the webpack branch of the\nconditional resolves to webpack@^1.7.10, which is from 2014. webpack\nand @rspack/cli have completely different major lines and can''t share\na version.\n\nWrap the version in the same if_eq block as the package name:\n\n  \"{{#if_eq buildTool ''webpack''}}webpack{{else}}@rspack/cli{{/if_eq}}\":\n  \"{{#if_eq buildTool ''webpack''}}^5.99.9{{else}}^1.7.10{{/if_eq}}\"\n\nSo buildTool=webpack -> webpack@^5.99.9 and buildTool=rspack ->\n@rspack/cli@^1.7.10. Existing template tests still pass (74/75; 1\npre-existing skip).","tree":{"sha":"3a2a13403e396a193b8f40319e85e93f7bb03e02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/trees/3a2a13403e396a193b8f40319e85e93f7bb03e02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/commits/e1c2dba201ae119b04d04a44209058a0c0e9f208","verification":{"payload":null