":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/6e29b2b7f3ce1173ee73ca21e79b26ff867178b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T20:10:03Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T20:10:03Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"message":"(fix) Fix generated template output for deps, extensions, and metadata\n\nUse triple-brace Handlebars expressions in routes.json and index.ts to\nprevent HTML-escaping of backend dependency versions containing >=. Render\nthe actual parsed version instead of hardcoding ^1.0.0 in routes.json or\nemitting the array index in index.ts.\n\nSwitch export identifiers in index.ts from kebabCase (which produces invalid\nJS identifiers like export const visit-summary) to camelCase, and use\ncomponentName consistently for both exports and import paths so they match\nthe filenames generated by engine.ts.\n\nSwitch the component field in routes.json from kebabCase to camelCase so it\nmatches the named export in index.ts that the O3 framework resolves against.\n\nFix generated package.json GitHub URLs that interpolated the scoped\npackageName (producing github.com/openmrs/@openmrs/esm-foo) to use\nprojectName with the openmrs-esm- prefix instead.\n\nFix generated README to use routes.[0].path instead of routes.[0].route\n(which doesn''t exist on the config), with leading slash stripping to avoid\ndouble slashes in the URL.","tree":{"sha":"3f489eb4ba5f890e9c83274ba5fd8f272f332f73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/trees/3f489eb4ba5f890e9c83274ba5fd8f272f332f73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/commits/6e29b2b7f3ce1173ee73ca21e79b26ff867178b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/create-o3-app/commit/6e29b2b7f3ce1173ee73ca21e79b26ff867178b5","node_id":"C_kwDOQz_jx9oAKDZlMjliMmI3ZjNjZTExNzNlZTczY2EyMWU3OWIyNmZmODY3MTc4YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openmrs/create-o3-app/commit/a70d694fcb937e0812a92de684c11f9a6edc76e0","sha":"a70d694fcb937e0812a92de684c11f9a6edc76e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/a70d694fcb937e0812a92de684c11f9a6edc76e0"}],"sha":"6e29b2b7f3ce1173ee73ca21e79b26ff867178b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/6e29b2b7f3ce1173ee73ca21e79b26ff867178b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/commits/a70d694fcb937e0812a92de684c11f9a6edc76e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-29T20:09:22Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-29T20:09:22Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"denniskigen"},"message":"(fix) Fix backend dependency validation and module type selection\n\nBackend dependency rendering was completely broken: Handlebars HTML-escaped\noperators like >= in dependency strings, routes.json hardcoded ^1.0.0 as the\nversion for every dependency, and index.ts emitted the array index as the\nvalue. Fix by parsing dependency strings into { name, version } objects during\nprompting and splitting the validation schema into an input schema (string,\nfor prompt validation) and an object schema (for moduleConfigSchema).\n\nExtension and modal module types were unreachable from the interactive CLI\nflow because both branches of the module type selection hardcoded ''page''.\nReplace with a prompts select menu offering page, extension, and both options\nwhen running interactively.","tree":{"sha":"670878841e520ec1472442321282e19741c35159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/trees/670878841e520ec1472442321282e19741c