ke rspack the default build tool with --webpack override\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: The default build tool is now rspack instead of webpack.\nUsers who want webpack must explicitly use the --webpack flag.\n\nChanges:\n- Set rspack as the default build tool (was webpack)\n- Add --webpack flag to opt into webpack explicitly\n- Deprecate --rspack flag with warning (still works for backward compatibility)\n- Update all test fixtures to use rspack as default\n- Add tests verifying config file exclusion for both build tools\n- Update documentation (README, CLI help, template README)\n\nThe --rspack flag is now deprecated and will be removed in a future\nmajor version. It currently shows a warning but continues to work to\nmaintain backward compatibility with existing scripts.","tree":{"sha":"5df6c51dc73169cff00d009dc2fa265ce8da517c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/trees/5df6c51dc73169cff00d009dc2fa265ce8da517c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/create-o3-app/git/commits/2e5a95e92b5f37b05190eb0c6e27d1115ea4bac6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https