://api.github.com/users/ruben-28/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruben-28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruben-28/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ruben-28","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruben-28/JetSetGo/commits/be25b03d6d135e527da28ded6df4a3a8d3c92513/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-05T14:10:22Z","email":"rubensbensimon@Gmail.com","name":"Ruben Bensimon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-05T14:10:22Z","email":"rubensbensimon@Gmail.com","name":"Ruben Bensimon"},"message":"feat: Modernize booking interfaces and fix critical bugs\n\nUI Improvements:\n- Redesigned Packages, Flights, and Hotels views with modern card-based layouts\n- Updated History (My Bookings) view with card-based design\n- Added glassmorphism effects and improved visual hierarchy\n- Implemented 2-column grid layouts for better space utilization\n- Added emoji icons and color-coded badges for booking types\n- Fixed navigation button signal connections\n\nBackend Fixes:\n- Fixed price storage issue - prices were defaulting to 0.0\n- Updated _create_booking_record to properly extract price from events\n- Added fallback to check event.data dictionary for price/adults\n- Removed response_model constraints from booking endpoints to prevent validation errors\n- Added trip_id field to BookingOut model\n\nAll booking types (flights, hotels, packages) now work correctly with proper price display.","tree":{"sha":"44a354441ec83d7f29db0eb5bd8007e9073e9cf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruben-28/JetSetGo/git/trees/44a354441ec83d7f29db0eb5bd8007e9073e9cf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ruben-28/JetSetGo/git/commits/be25b03d6d135e527da28ded6df4a3a8d3c92513","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.