"name":"Sébastien Barbier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T08:39:20Z","email":"3018618+sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sébastien Barbier"},"message":"chore(deps): apply Dependabot security fixes\n\nDirect dependencies:\n- vitest ^4.0.18 -> ^4.1.11 in packages/cli and packages/core\n  (also brings @vitest/mocker 4.0.18 -> 4.1.11)\n\nTransitive dependencies, refreshed in pnpm-lock.yaml within the\nranges their parents already allow (no overrides needed):\n- image-size 2.0.2 -> 2.0.4\n- js-yaml 3.14.2 -> 3.15.2 and 4.1.1 -> 4.3.2\n- colord 2.9.3 -> 2.10.0\n- joi 17.13.3 -> 17.13.8\n- svgo 3.3.2 -> 3.3.5\n- qs 6.14.1 -> 6.16.0 (via express 4.22.3, body-parser 1.20.8)\n- browserslist 4.28.1 -> 4.29.3\n- baseline-browser-mapping 2.9.15 -> 2.11.27\n- nanoid 3.3.11 -> 3.3.20 (via postcss 8.5.29)\n- @humanfs/node 0.16.7 -> 0.16.8\n- fast-uri 3.1.0 -> 3.1.8\n- postcss-selector-parser 6.1.2 -> 6.1.4 and 7.1.1 -> 7.1.6\n- brace-expansion 1.1.12 -> 1.1.21, 2.0.2 -> 2.1.7, 5.0.9 -> 5.0.12\n- @ai-sdk/provider-utils 3.0.20 -> 3.0.30 (via ai 5.0.222 and\n  @ai-sdk/react 2.0.224, the last releases before undici 5 was added)\n\nRemove packages/core/pnpm-lock.yaml: a stale lockfile left over from\nbefore the pnpm workspace. pnpm only uses the root lockfile, but\nDependabot still scanned this one and reported vitest, @vitest/mocker\nand nanoid alerts against it.\n\npnpm audit: 124 -> 55 advisories.","tree":{"sha":"5f46dfc0c77687caa72c239e9b4bcad4daaa74f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/trees/5f46dfc0c77687caa72c239e9b4bcad4daaa74f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/commits/69abe440d2626a2a0e2764d4f14b2f5394521f78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3018618?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sebastienbarbier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api