r.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"fix(ai): stop Default model select focus ring from clipping horizontally\n\nThe AI details inner uses overflow:hidden for the 0fr→1fr collapse animation,\nwhich clipped the Select focus-visible ring + ring-offset flush against the\npanel edges (top/bottom looked fine; left/right were cut).\n\nAdd a small padding-inline (0.25rem) for ring room while keeping the control\nfull-width-ish, and set overflow:visible when open so focus rings paint fully.\nPairs with the earlier 1fr stretch hug-content fix.","tree":{"sha":"5a52b727cbf52c9e2271e3ef8a39d1a82471c27b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/trees/5a52b727cbf52c9e2271e3ef8a39d1a82471c27b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/commits/657d7857d0a51af564649898ca7bdb3d5decab08","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a52b727cbf52c9e2271e3ef8a39d1a82471c27b\nparent ca0c81e1e6a09cfd18a2bdd3f8a94b8673a77665\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789802471 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789802471 +0000\n\nfix(ai): stop Default model select focus ring from clipping horizontally\n\nThe AI details inner uses overflow:hidden for the 0fr→1fr collapse animation,\nwhich clipped the Select focus-visible ring + ring-offset flush against the\npanel edges (top/bottom looked fine; left/right were cut).\n\nAdd a small padding-inline (0.25rem) for ring room while keeping the control\nfull-width-ish, and set overflow:visible when open so focus rings paint fully.\nPairs with the earlier 1fr stretch hug-content fix.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLuIfKvqR7wV4BEn+P+aNOcHJq32Nh5eQ90g7v8SPhDi59joZZHoDC5d9PM3CrkC3j\n774YIiVYoEe9bnHcizWwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-19T07:21:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avata