e":"2026-09-18T09:13:33Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"Fixes #60: postMessage origin allowlist and trusted-frame registry\n\nImplement H-06/M-13/M-14 message bus hardening:\n- Origin allowlist and registered-frame checks in messageListenerRegistry\n- Shared privileged companion message policy (LOGIN/LOGOUT, modal, dialog, toast, chrome actions)\n- Concrete target origins for outbound SDK/shell postMessage (no wildcard)\n- Config-derived allowlist bootstrap from shellui.config.json navigation/storage URLs\n- Tests for hostile origin/source rejection and registered frame acceptance\n- Docs/changelog updates for configureMessageSecurity knobs","tree":{"sha":"4e589a326252ec519b9c90873b49d46ed0a536d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/trees/4e589a326252ec519b9c90873b49d46ed0a536d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/commits/0c80fdfa1bf42dd1e1b0e7d89f2afd1d8c750ee0","verification":{"payload":"tree 4e589a326252ec519b9c90873b49d46ed0a536d2\nparent e49767fe92180494dcf7b982165d447b484e1bbe\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789722813 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789722813 +0000\n\nFixes #60: postMessage origin allowlist and trusted-frame registry\n\nImplement H-06/M-13/M-14 message bus hardening:\n- Origin allowlist and registered-frame checks in messageListenerRegistry\n- Shared privileged companion message policy (LOGIN/LOGOUT, modal, dialog, toast, chrome actions)\n- Concrete target origins for outbound SDK/shell postMessage (no wildcard)\n- Config-derived allowlist bootstrap from shellui.config.json navigation/storage URLs\n- Tests for hostile origin/source rejection and registered frame acceptance\n- Docs/changelog updates for configureMessageSecurity knobs\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1l