llow (loopback default, warn remote, reject\n  metadata); add --allow-remote-companion flag.\n\nFixes #65\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: sebastienbarbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ca83e3724bbf0a61245166d426f47de1e6b8db6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/trees/9ca83e3724bbf0a61245166d426f47de1e6b8db6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/commits/13075a11ed2a557e99aa2393f85b54fc213e3598","verification":{"payload":"tree 9ca83e3724bbf0a61245166d426f47de1e6b8db6\nparent e49767fe92180494dcf7b982165d447b484e1bbe\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789722468 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789722468 +0000\n\nfix(security): Track F companion isolation + CLI hardening (#65)\n\nImplement M-18 and L-10..L-14 from the 2026-09-17 security assessment:\n\n- M-18: Tighten content iframe sandbox (drop allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox),\n  centralize policy in contentIframeSandbox.ts, document distinct-origin dev\n  plan in docs/features/companion-isolation.md.\n- L-10: Document CLI credential plaintext-at-rest residual with 0600/0700\n  permissions; export CREDENTIAL_STORAGE_RESIDUAL for tooling/docs.\n- L-11: Bind loopback /capture to one-time session nonce (header + JSON body);\n  pass OAuth state from the same nonce.\n- L-12: Harden loopback UX (terminal + HTML pages show port/nonce and\n  anti-phishing guidance); expand docs/cli.md threat model.\n- L-13: Warn on out-of-tree config paths, reject world-writable and symlink-\n  escaped config files; document TS execution threat model.\n- L-14: Validate dev.url / --follow (loopback default, warn remote, reject\n  metadata); add --allow-remote-companion flag.\n\nFixes #65\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\nCo-authored-by: sebastienbarbier <sebastienbarbier@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3No