hell CSP\n\nH-09 / M-17 incremental hardening for issue #64:\n\n- Split persisted auth: profile in localStorage, refresh in sessionStorage,\n  access token memory-only; migrate legacy shellui.auth.session\n- Optional security.bffAuth.enabled: same-origin /api/auth/* with HttpOnly\n  refresh cookies (CLI dev + serve:dist); document identity follow-ups\n- Shell CSP with SHA-256 hash for inline theme bootstrap; report-only by\n  default via security.csp with staged enforce rollout\n- Docs (features/security.md), schema, changelog, unit tests\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"93875b000683d417f4c232d6578f07ee15293433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/trees/93875b000683d417f4c232d6578f07ee15293433"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shellui/shellui/git/commits/6e7b663904c7117143005712a92cf7fd850351de","verification":{"payload":"tree 93875b000683d417f4c232d6578f07ee15293433\nparent e49767fe92180494dcf7b982165d447b484e1bbe\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789722217 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1789722217 +0000\n\nfeat(security): split auth storage, BFF HttpOnly refresh, shell CSP\n\nH-09 / M-17 incremental hardening for issue #64:\n\n- Split persisted auth: profile in localStorage, refresh in sessionStorage,\n  access token memory-only; migrate legacy shellui.auth.session\n- Optional security.bffAuth.enabled: same-origin /api/auth/* with HttpOnly\n  refresh cookies (CLI dev + serve:dist); document identity follow-ups\n- Shell CSP with SHA-256 hash for inline theme bootstrap; report-only by\n  default via security.csp with staged enforce rollout\n- Docs (features/security.md), schema, changelog, unit tests\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDZLazZf/QJaHh