_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SummaDiaboli/microfrontend-auth/commits/6dca7e09a6f0a33bdf67ed5b6afcf6e9dcafcc51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-15T22:24:59Z","email":"salimabdu008@gmail.com","name":"SummaDiaboli"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-15T22:24:59Z","email":"salimabdu008@gmail.com","name":"SummaDiaboli"},"message":"feat: Complete microfrontend authentication testbed overhaul\n\n🔧 **Build & Dependency Fixes:**\n- Fixed MUI React 19 compatibility issues with legacy peer deps\n- Resolved missing @mui/material modules (TextareaAutosize, ToggleButton, etc.)\n- Added missing imports: Drawer, useNavigate, and other MUI components\n- Fixed webpack build errors across all setups\n\n🎨 **UI/UX Standardization:**\n- Unified home page layouts across all three authentication setups\n- Consistent navigation bar with dropdown menus and profile actions\n- Standardized responsive design with mobile drawer navigation\n- Added proper loading states and performance monitoring widgets\n- Implemented smooth animations with Framer Motion\n\n🔐 **Authentication Improvements:**\n- Fixed BFF authentication pattern with proper API endpoints\n- Corrected logout functionality and navigation redirects\n- Added loading states for authentication forms\n- Improved error handling and user feedback\n\n⚡ **Performance Optimizations:**\n- Commented out artificial loading delays for faster development\n- Achieved perfect CLS (0.000) scores through stable layouts\n- Optimized bundle sizes and build processes\n- Maintained excellent Core Web Vitals performance\n\n🏗️ **Architecture Enhancements:**\n- Standardized component structure across all setups\n- Improved microfrontend integration and module federation\n- Added shared components and consistent styling\n- Enhanced developer experience with better error messages\n\n📊 **Monitoring & Analytics:**\n- Web Vitals integration (CLS, FID, FCP, LCP, TTFB)\n- Real-time performance metrics display\n- Pattern-specific labeling for comparison\n- Comprehensive error logging and debugging\n\n🔄 **Three Authentication Patterns:**\n- Setup-1: Local Storage Pattern\n- Setup-2: HttpOnly Cookies Pattern\n- Setup-3: Backend-for-Frontend (BFF) Pattern\n\nAll patterns now provide identical user experience while demonstrating different authentication security approaches, perfect for evaluation and comparison.","tree":{"sha":"e598dd08a8460981c1d02896c3a52951afaf6236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SummaDiaboli/microfrontend-auth/git/trees/e598dd08a8460981c1d02896c3a52951afaf6236"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SummaDiaboli/microfrontend-auth/git/commits/6dca7e09a6f0a33bdf67ed5b6afcf6e9dcafcc51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50989754?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SummaDiaboli","id":50989754,"login":"SummaDiaboli","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwOTg5NzU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/SummaDiaboli","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/SummaDiaboli/microfrontend-auth/commit/6dca7e09a6f0a33bdf67ed5b6afcf6e9dcafcc51","node_id":"C_kwDOQ00KjNoAKDZkY2E3ZTA5YTZmMGEzM2JkZjY3ZWQ1YjZhZmNmNmU5ZGNh