_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/0f41ea10ab78f7008c02a0f1022454372b131e1f","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKDBmNDFlYTEwYWI3OGY3MDA4YzAyYTBmMTAyMjQ1NDM3MmIxMzFlMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/6fd9d3d981e7009bdd3eab1eaca5f28eeacb1e05","sha":"6fd9d3d981e7009bdd3eab1eaca5f28eeacb1e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/6fd9d3d981e7009bdd3eab1eaca5f28eeacb1e05"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/5f87a067e0ad2b3ec9342d389c1bdcb14355a236","sha":"5f87a067e0ad2b3ec9342d389c1bdcb14355a236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/5f87a067e0ad2b3ec9342d389c1bdcb14355a236"}],"sha":"0f41ea10ab78f7008c02a0f1022454372b131e1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/0f41ea10ab78f7008c02a0f1022454372b131e1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/5f87a067e0ad2b3ec9342d389c1bdcb14355a236/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:16:17Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T03:16:17Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"중재가 근거를 지우지 않는다 — 진 쪽은 보조 근거로 남는다\n\n**안 되던 것.** 교차 프로세스 중재가 한 룰의 집을 하나 고르고 **나머지를 지웠다**\n(`explore_service.py` `delete_task_rule_mapping`). 그래서 그 룰이 **유일한\n근거**였던 task 는 근거를 통째로 잃었다.\n\n**원인은 정책이 데이터를 못 담는 것이다.** 레거시의 룰 단위(루틴)가 설계의 task\n단위보다 굵다 — 메서드 하나가 입력 검증·DTO·상태·저장을 다 하므로, 검증기는 그\n룰을 여러 task 에 **정당하게** 붙인다. \"한 룰은 한 task 에만 산다\" 를 강제하면\n굵은 룰 하나당 task N−1 개가 반드시 빈다(accepted=1 이면 0이 된다).\n\nenterprise 실측(hr-sample · task 29): 수락 81 → 그래프에 남은 것 35,\n**task 12개가 근거를 통째로 잃었다.** 그 12개는 전부 중재에서만 잃었다 —\nStep 1·문턱 손실은 0건이었다(recall@20 = 19/19, RESCUED 0건).\n\n**고침.** 집은 여전히 하나만 고르되(`evidence_role=''primary''`) 진 쪽은 남긴다\n(`supporting`). 지우는 것은 중복 제거가 아니라 **추적 상실**이었다.\n\n  · `verdict.reject` 는 그대로 지운다 — \"집이 어디냐\" 가 아니라 \"근거가 아니다\"\n    라는 판정이다. 그 경로는 따로 센다(`deleted`).\n  · 역할이 승격까지 이어진다 — `(UserStory)-[:SOURCED_FROM {evidence_role}]->(Rule)`\n  · 출처 조회가 역할을 함께 주고 **주 근거를 먼저** 보낸다\n  · 화면이 보조를 흐리게 + \"보조\" 배지로 구분한다\n  · 마무리에 손실 규모를 한 줄로 남긴다 — SSE 로만 나가면 화면을 닫는 순간\n    사라져서 \"매핑이 왜 적냐\" 를 사후에 되짚을 수 없다\n\n없으면 `primary` 로 읽는다 — 이 정책 전에 만든 엣지가 그렇다. 이름은\n`es_role`(어느 ES 요소로 승격하나)과 헷갈리지 않게 `evidence_role` 로 쓴다.\n\n**검증.**\n\n    test_arbitration_keeps_evidence  8 통과\n    되돌려 확인                       `delete` 로 되돌리면 1건 실패 — 헛돌지 않는다\n    api 전체                         1552 통과 / 3 실패\n                                    실패 3건은 claude_code 계약 검사로 이 변경 전에도 실패\n    UserStoryDetail.vue              SFC 파싱·템플릿·스타일 통과\n                                    (전체 vite 빌드는 이 작업 트리에 open-pencil 이\n                                     없어 못 돌렸다 — 이 변경과 무관한 사유다)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73be0e3a86fade673ca088b717599db33fed566c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/73be0e3a86fade673ca088b717599db33fed566c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/5f87a067e0ad2b3ec9342d389c1bdcb14355a236","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/5f87a067e0ad2b3ec9342d389c1bdcb14355a236","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKDVmODdhMDY3ZTBhZDJiM2VjOTM0MmQzODljMWJkY2IxNDM1NWEyMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/a01275b31165afc452ba2535c5dac250d18e3e27","sha":"a01275b31165afc452ba2535c5dac250d18e3e27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/a01275b31165afc452ba2535c5dac250d18e3e27"}],"sha":"5f87a067e0ad2b3ec9342d389c1bdcb14355a236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/5f87a067e0ad2b3ec9342d389c1bdcb14355a236"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/a01275b31165afc452ba2535c5dac250d18e3e27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:31:44Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T02:31:44Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"실그래프에서 돌려 보니 두 군데가 더 막고 있었다\n\n이식본을 hr-sample(`prj_737cf4cd88`)에 끝까지 돌려 보다 찾았다. 둘 다\n`main` 만의 결함이고, Step 1 과 별개로 **각각 단독으로 치명적**이다.\n\n**① 세션 스냅샷 질의가 문법 오류다.**\n\n    WITH am WHERE r IS NULL\n    → cypher error: variable ''r'' is not defined in this query\n\n`WITH am` 투영이 `r` 을 떨어뜨리는데 뒤따르는 WHERE 가 그것을 본다.\n`WITH am, r` 로 함께 넘긴다. 이게 막히면 `_build_session_dtos` 가 통째로\n실패해서 **탐색이 시작도 못 한다.**\n\n**② 노드 id 가 정수로 와서 RuleDTO 가 전건 거부된다.**\n\n    source_function_id  Input should be a valid string, input_value=18348100288514\n\nontological 게이트웨이는 `_id` 를 정수로 돌려주는데 DTO 의 세 필드는 `str`\n이다. pydantic 이 막아서 **룰이 한 건도 안 만들어진다.** `_as_id()` 로\n문자열로 바꿔 넣는다.\n\n**실측 — 이식 전후 (세션 `a616ec1d` · 프로세스 3 · task 28 · 룰 68)**\n\n    게이트에서 스킵된 프로세스   3 / 3  →  **0 / 3**\n    수락된 매핑                   0     →  **20**\n    매핑된 task                   0     →  13 / 28\n\n`accepted > 0` 은 닫혔다. 13/28 은 **바닥값**이다 — 이 측정은 배치 경로를\n한 번 돈 것이고, 실제 파이프라인은 task 별 재탐색과 중재를 더 돈다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa1e721bf68ad4c0dee0b354fc9f23829288a0a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/aa1e721bf68ad4c0dee0b354fc9f23829288a0a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/a01275b31165afc452ba2535c5dac250d18e3e27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/a01275b31165afc452ba2535c5dac250d18e3e27","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKGEwMTI3NWIzMTE2NWFmYzQ1MmJhMjUzNWM1ZGFjMjUwZDE4ZTNlMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/38ad53ad772d1575bf5911fdcbbc539c00b90fb8","sha":"38ad53ad772d1575bf5911fdcbbc539c00b90fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/38ad53ad772d1575bf5911fdcbbc539c00b90fb8"}],"sha":"a01275b31165afc452ba2535c5dac250d18e3e27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/a01275b31165afc452ba2535c5dac250d18e3e27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/38ad53ad772d1575bf5911fdcbbc539c00b90fb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:40:20Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T01:40:20Z","email":"yang1762@uengine.org","name":"seongwonyang"},"message":"Step 1 을 루틴 단위로 되돌린다 — main 은 지금 매핑이 0이다\n\n**안 되던 것.** `main` 에서 룰 매핑이 한 건도 안 된다. 적게 되는 것이 아니라\n프로세스가 **게이트에서 전건 스킵**된다.\n\n    AgentDone { accepted: 0, skipped: true,\n                reason: \"process_max_container_score=0.000 < 0.55\" }\n\n**원인.** 애널라이저가 2026-08-20 `f91f90da` 로 컨테이너 요약을 없앴다(의도된\n설계 — 담당자 확인). 그 변경은 **애널라이저 `main` 에 있다**. 기업 분기만의\n일이 아니다. 그런데 이쪽 Step 1 은 CLASS/FILE 의 `summary` 로 후보를 만든다.\n\n측정(hr-sample, `prj_737cf4cd88_a`, Postgres 직접):\n\n    CLASS   30행 · summary   0   (p_summary 컬럼 없음, __ext 도 비어 있다)\n    FILE     1행 · summary   0\n    METHOD 171행 · summary 171   ← 루틴에만 있다\n\n`__ext` jsonb 까지 열어 확인했다 — 컬럼만 보고 단정했다가 틀린 적이 있다.\n\n**고침.** 컨테이너 단위 Step 1 을 루틴 단위로 바꾼다. `enterprise-custom-p`\n에서 측정으로 지지된 것만 옮겼다 —\n\n  · `module_retriever` 가 METHOD/FUNCTION 요약으로 후보를 만든다\n  · 문턱은 얇게 두되 **비울 수는 없게** 한다(rescue + per-task 통계)\n  · 질의에서 `domain_keywords` 를 뺀다 (정답파일 hit@5 21/28 -> 28/28)\n  · 세션 임베딩 캐시 — task 마다 코퍼스를 다시 임베딩하지 않는다\n\n**기업 전용 배선은 가져오지 않았다.** `api/platform/embeddings.py`(사내\n게이트웨이 라우팅), Example/GWT 계약 확장, 주/보조 근거는 이 변경에 없다.\n이름도 main 것을 그대로 쓴다 — `source_function_id`(= 루틴 `_id`),\n`process_containers`. 들어온 쪽을 맞췄지 main 을 흔들지 않았다.\n\n**함께 되살린 것.** `6fd9d3d` 가 `condition_extractor.py` 를 지우면서\n`explore_service` 의 import 는 남겨 두었다. `router` 가 그것을 함수 안에서\n늦게 부르므로 앱은 뜨지만 **탐색 엔드포인트가 호출 시점에 죽는다.**\n\n**검증.**\n\n    mapper 검사        56 통과 (새 407줄 포함)\n    api 전체          1542 통과 / 3 실패\n                      실패 3건은 claude_code 계약 검사로 **이 변경 전에도 실패**한다\n    실그래프 Step 1    코퍼스 루틴 171건 (바꾸기 전 0건)\n\n남은 것: 끝까지 한 번 돌려 `accepted > 0` 과 매핑 task 28/28 을 본다.\n지금은 OpenAI 키가 전부 401(폐기됨)이라 임베딩을 못 불러 확인하지 못했다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8164e81894ed6dd6f02f5861f82d805eb0fa8b05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/8164e81894ed6dd6f02f5861f82d805eb0fa8b05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/38ad53ad772d1575bf5911fdcbbc539c00b90fb8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112850933?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uengineYSW","id":112850933,"login":"uengineYSW","node_id":"U_kgDOBrn39Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uengineYSW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/38ad53ad772d1575bf5911fdcbbc539c00b90fb8","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKDM4YWQ1M2FkNzcyZDE1NzViZjU5MTFmZGNiYmM1MzljMDBiOTBmYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/6fd9d3d981e7009bdd3eab1eaca5f28eeacb1e05","sha":"6fd9d3d981e7009bdd3eab1eaca5f28eeacb1e05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/6fd9d3d981e7009bdd3eab1eaca5f28eeacb1e05"}],"sha":"38ad53ad772d1575bf5911fdcbbc539c00b90fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/38ad53ad772d1575bf5911fdcbbc539c00b90fb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_