:"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/a99a85f84850a945d6b6a9fd4fccdf7fea7bf847/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T08:10:58Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T08:10:58Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"chore(submodules): analyzer 4종 포인터를 원격 최신으로 동기화\n\nanalyzer·catalog·fabric·frontend 가 각자 원격에서 1커밋씩 앞서 있어\n아키텍트가 참조하는 커밋이 본진과 달랐다. 네 서브모듈 모두 원격 HEAD 로\nfast-forward 해 참조를 일치시킨다. 진행 중인 로컬 수정과 겹치는 파일이\n없음을 확인한 뒤 전진했고, 각 서브모듈의 작업트리 변경은 보존된다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dad685bac950c754884510d3ef112de141d847c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/7dad685bac950c754884510d3ef112de141d847c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/a99a85f84850a945d6b6a9fd4fccdf7fea7bf847","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/a99a85f84850a945d6b6a9fd4fccdf7fea7bf847","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKGE5OWE4NWY4NDg1MGE5NDVkNmI2YTlmZDRmY2NkZjdmZWE3YmY4NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/bb6e7b5cdbb1a9d44a69183be99110af79252f3b","sha":"bb6e7b5cdbb1a9d44a69183be99110af79252f3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/bb6e7b5cdbb1a9d44a69183be99110af79252f3b"}],"sha":"a99a85f84850a945d6b6a9fd4fccdf7fea7bf847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/a99a85f84850a945d6b6a9fd4fccdf7fea7bf847"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/bb6e7b5cdbb1a9d44a69183be99110af79252f3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:56:31Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:56:31Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"fix(proposals): 근거 카드 클릭도 같은 패널을 연다 — 클릭 규칙 통일\n\n요소 꼬리표를 누르면 패널이 뜨는데 근거 카드를 누르면 강조만 되어, 같은 카드처럼\n생긴 것이 서로 다르게 동작했다. \"누르면 뭐가 뜨는지\"를 예측할 수 없었다.\n\n- 근거 카드 클릭도 동일한 근거 패널을 연다. 담기는 내용만 반대다:\n  요소 클릭 = 그 요소가 쓴 근거들 / 근거 클릭 = 그 근거의 원문 + 인용한 요소 목록.\n  패널이 element 형태를 받으므로 근거 1건짜리 가상 요소로 감싸 컴포넌트를 재사용한다.\n- 패널이 화면 오른쪽에서 근거 목록을 덮어 가려진 카드를 다시 누를 수 없던 문제를\n  발견(자동화가 30초 재시도 후 실패). 패널이 열리는 동안 목록을 자동으로 접고\n  닫으면 되돌린다.\n- 실측: member_get_grade 클릭 시 member.c:891~965 원문 + 인용 요소 4개, 좌측은\n  그 4곳만 남고 나머지 dim.\n\n검증: UI 스위트 30/30(패널 통일·자동 접힘·복귀 회귀 검사), pytest 113.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0930a321c9df2bae17da78bc2539ce0db7e2c8a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/0930a321c9df2bae17da78bc2539ce0db7e2c8a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/bb6e7b5cdbb1a9d44a69183be99110af79252f3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/bb6e7b5cdbb1a9d44a69183be99110af79252f3b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKGJiNmU3YjVjZGJiMWE5ZDQ0YTY5MTgzYmU5OTExMGFmNzkyNTJmM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/e6aca49d75c158c8b500bcdf270f0d3094938ac2","sha":"e6aca49d75c158c8b500bcdf270f0d3094938ac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/e6aca49d75c158c8b500bcdf270f0d3094938ac2"}],"sha":"bb6e7b5cdbb1a9d44a69183be99110af79252f3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/bb6e7b5cdbb1a9d44a69183be99110af79252f3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/e6aca49d75c158c8b500bcdf270f0d3094938ac2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:25:31Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T06:25:31Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"feat(proposals): 근거 카드 클릭 → 그 근거를 쓴 요소 고정(역방향 탐색)\n\n우측 근거 목록의 카드가 눌리게 생겼는데 클릭에 아무 반응이 없었다(hover 전용).\n\"이 근거를 어디서 쓰고 있나\"는 자연스러운 질문인데 그 방향의 탐색이 없었다.\n\n- 근거 카드를 클릭하면 그 근거를 인용한 요소만 남기고 나머지는 물러난다.\n  마우스를 떼도 유지되므로 천천히 볼 수 있고, 다시 누르면 해제된다.\n  실측: apply_point_balance 고정 시 요소 7개 강조 · 32개 dim · 선 7개.\n- 요소 hover(설계→근거)와 대칭이 되어 양방향 추적이 완성된다.\n- 레일 안내 문구를 \"마우스를 올리면 연결선, 클릭하면 고정\"으로 갱신.\n\n검증: UI 스위트 29/29(고정 유지·해제·대칭 dim 회귀 검사 신규), pytest 113.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff9331faab974b07ede47b33052565946dab47bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/ff9331faab974b07ede47b33052565946dab47bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/e6aca49d75c158c8b500bcdf270f0d3094938ac2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/e6aca49d75c158c8b500bcdf270f0d3094938ac2","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKGU2YWNhNDlkNzVjMTU4YzhiNTAwYmNkZjI3MGYwZDMwOTQ5MzhhYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/3e7c93b1b60ffa7b24f8a6c7b26a880d3cb7aaba","sha":"3e7c93b1b60ffa7b24f8a6c7b26a880d3cb7aaba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/3e7c93b1b60ffa7b24f8a6c7b26a880d3cb7aaba"}],"sha":"e6aca49d75c158c8b500bcdf270f0d3094938ac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/e6aca49d75c158c8b500bcdf270f0d3094938ac2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/3e7c93b1b60ffa7b24f8a6c7b26a880d3cb7aaba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:54:36Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:54:36Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"fix(proposals): 근거 hover 시 무관 항목을 물러나게 — 선만으로는 추적이 어렵다\n\n연결선을 hover 대상으로 줄였는데도, 카드 간 거리가 멀어 선 5개가 비슷한 각도로 나가면\n어느 근거가 관련 있는지 눈으로 따라가야 했다. 세 안(선만 / 선+대비 / 대비만)을 같은\n조건에서 촬영해 비교한 결과, 선만으로는 12개 근거가 전부 같은 밝기라 판별이 늦었다.\n\n- 요소를 hover 하면 그 요소의 근거만 남기고 무관한 근거는 물러난다(opacity 0.28).\n  선은 방향 정보로 유지 — 대비가 \"무엇이\", 선이 \"어디서\"를 담당한다.\n- 실측 예: PointAccount hover 시 선 5개 + 무관 근거 21개 dim.\n\n검증: UI 스위트 25/25(포커스 대비 회귀 검사 신규), 상세 DDD 화면 8/8.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b38a40173d632303a76d3ab1d5525438b56418da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/b38a40173d632303a76d3ab1d5525438b56418da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/3e7c93b1b60ffa7b24f8a6c7b26a880d3cb7aaba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/3e7c93b1b60ffa7b24f8a6c7b26a880d3cb7aaba","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKDNlN2M5M2IxYjYwZmZhN2IyNGY4YTZjN2IyNmE4ODBkM2NiN2FhYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/5dc74b2ffa4c0ef6297d5beababc04d201c9a28b","sha":"5dc74b2ffa4c0ef6297d5beababc04d201c9a28b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/5dc74b2ffa4c0ef6297d5beababc04d201c9a28b"}],"sha":"3e7c93b1b60ffa7b24f8a6c7b26a880d3cb7aaba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/3e7c93b1b60ffa7b24f8a6c7b26a880d3cb7aaba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/5dc74b2ffa4c0ef6297d5beababc04d201c9a28b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:44:37Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T04:44:37Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"fix(proposals): 근거 연결선 가독성 — 전체를 그리지 않고 보는 것만 그린다\n\n검증 모드가 요소↔근거 연결선을 전부 그리다 보니, 근거가 많은 제안에서 선이 서로\n교차해 아무것도 읽히지 않았다(실측: 인용 26개에서 판독 불가). 선을 예쁘게 그리는\n문제가 아니라 동시에 그릴 양의 문제다.\n\n- 연결선은 마우스를 올린 요소(또는 근거)의 것만 그린다. 검증 모드에서도 전체를\n  그리지 않는다 — \"빠짐없이 판정됐다\"는 판정 칩과 커버리지 숫자가 이미 보여준다.\n  hover 시 최대 몇 개만 남으므로 선을 굵고 밝게 해 확실히 읽히게 했다.\n- 우측 근거 레일을 접을 수 있게 했다. 근거가 많아도 설계 트리를 압도하지 않고,\n  레일 안에서만 스크롤한다. 연결선이 hover 전용임을 레일 상단에 안내한다.\n\n검증: UI 스위트 24/24(레일 접기·검증모드 상시선 0 포함), 상세 DDD 화면 8/8을\n완전연결(39/39)·부분연결(30/32) 두 제안으로 교차 확인, pytest 113, 프론트 unit 10.\n검증 스크립트의 \"점선 마크 ≥1\" 상수 기대는 커버리지에서 미연결 수를 읽어 대조하도록\n수정 — 전부 연결된 제안에서는 점선이 0인 것이 정상이다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c7dc3b9afb62723b3a1e8fec290464e136cf6ace","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/c7dc3b9afb62723b3a1e8fec290464e136cf6ace"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/5dc74b2ffa4c0ef6297d5beababc04d201c9a28b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/5dc74b2ffa4c0ef6297d5beababc04d201c9a28b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKDVkYzc0YjJmZmE0YzBlZjYyOTdkNWJlYWJhYmMwNGQyMDFjOWEyOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/10a5e0e19ac3cc41a2b513a4ca5c854883a1d6e6","sha":"10a5e0e19ac3cc41a2b513a4ca5c854883a1d6e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/10a5e0e19ac3cc41a2b513a4ca5c854883a1d6e6"}],"sha":"5dc74b2ffa4c0ef6297d5beababc04d201c9a28b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/5dc74b2ffa4c0ef6297d5beababc04d201c9a28b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/10a5e0e19ac3cc41a2b513a4ca5c854883a1d6e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T03:37:53Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T03:37:53Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"fix(proposals): 레거시 근거 재현율 개선 — 검색량이 아니라 배분을 고친다\n\n실측: 상세 DDD 실행에서 요소 51개 중 11개가 근거 없이 나왔다. 원인을 분해하니\n누락의 93%가 \"검색을 안 해서\"가 아니라 **이미 검색해 놓고 요소에 붙이지 않아서**였다\n(후보 122개를 확보한 실행에서 발생). 예: TACTICAL 단계가 settlement_close 를\n\"정산 건을 마감 처리한다\"는 요약과 함께 검색해 놓고도 CloseSettlement·SettlementClosed\n요소를 빈 채로 남겼다.\n\n이 현상은 문헌에서 \"Not Extracted\"(RAG 7대 실패점) / \"Evidence Override\" 로 명명된\n지배적 실패 모드이고, 보고된 비율(검색 실패의 4~7배)도 우리 측정과 방향이 같다.\n따라서 호출 상한을 늘리는 처방은 비용만 늘리고 지배 원인을 남긴다.\n\n계약 재설계 (references/legacy-reference.md)\n- 1패스 → S1 탐색 / S2 심층 / **S3 배분** / S4 갭마감 4단계.\n- S3 배분이 핵심: 요소 초안 후 확보한 후보 목록을 **후보 → 요소 방향으로** 다시 훑는다.\n  \"이 요소의 근거가 뭐지?\"가 아니라 \"이 후보는 어느 요소를 뒷받침하나?\"를 묻는다.\n  추가 도구 호출 0. 이름이 아니라 요약으로 판단하고(레거시명과 설계명은 언어가 다르다),\n  상위 후보를 하위 Command/Event 에 배분한다.\n- 탐색 종료는 상한이 아니라 포화·커버리지 조건으로. 예산 감각은 축수+2, backstop 8회.\n  질의는 한 묶음으로 먼저 설계해 서로 겹치는 것을 합친다.\n- 빈 배열에는 입증 책임을 둔다 — S3·S4 를 거치지 않은 `[]` 는 계약 위반.\n- rule 인용은 응답 문장을 그대로 복사한다(코드 조건식 변환·요약 금지, ✅/❌ 예시 추가).\n\n실측 A/B (동일 프롬프트)\n- 상세 DDD: linked 40/51(78%) → **39/39(100%)**, 빈 근거 11 → 0, 소요 688s(기존과 동급)\n- 간소화 : linked 10/10, 경고 0, 소요 179s\n- 정밀도 확인(억지 연결 아님): ReservePoint ← point_use \"선차감의 원형 — 레거시는 예약\n  없이 즉시 차감하나 예약 상태를 신규 도입\", OrderCanceled ← rollback_order 등 파생 관계를\n  정확히 서술. 과잉 인용 1건과 규칙 문장 불일치 2건은 서버 관문이 차단(설계 의도대로).\n- 게이트 7/7(근거 364건 전건 그래프 해석), pytest 113, UI 21/21.\n\n검증 자산: verify/recall_diagnosis.py — 빈 근거를 배분누락/검색누락/정당신규로 자동 분해,\n배분누락이 남으면 exit 1(회귀 감지 지표).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d48b416293567a0ce8b8abcb1afece3a110d322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/6d48b416293567a0ce8b8abcb1afece3a110d322"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/10a5e0e19ac3cc41a2b513a4ca5c854883a1d6e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/10a5e0e19ac3cc41a2b513a4ca5c854883a1d6e6","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKDEwYTVlMGUxOWFjM2NjNDFhMmI1MTNhNGNhNWM4NTQ4ODNhMWQ2ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/651ce0fec6c9a2ee82985105fd67fde4a4e52cbc","sha":"651ce0fec6c9a2ee82985105fd67fde4a4e52cbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/651ce0fec6c9a2ee82985105fd67fde4a4e52cbc"}],"sha":"10a5e0e19ac3cc41a2b513a4ca5c854883a1d6e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/10a5e0e19ac3cc41a2b513a4ca5c854883a1d6e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/651ce0fec6c9a2ee82985105fd67fde4a4e52cbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T02:37:11Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T02:37:11Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"feat(proposals): 설계 요소별 레거시 근거 꼬리표 + 제안 경로 3종 정리\n\n생성된 모든 설계 요소에 \"이 요소가 레거시 어느 코드에서 나왔는지\"를 결정론적으로\n부착한다. 근거는 LLM 주장이 아니라 서버가 관찰한 도구 호출 기록으로만 성립한다.\n\n계약\n- 요소별 `legacyRefs: [{nodeId, role?, evidence?, field?}]` (strategic·tactical 공통).\n  근거 없으면 `[]`(신규), 키 부재는 unknown(구버전) — \"신규\"로 오표기하지 않는다.\n- 불변식: 저장되는 모든 nodeId ∈ 그 제안의 실제 검색·검토 집합. 위반은 제거 + 경고.\n  LLM 생성·수동 편집(PUT /diff, preview_edit) 모두 동일 관문(enforce_proposal_refs).\n- 내용 단위 인용: 응답에 내장돼 오는 RULE/EXAMPLE/TABLE 은 본 내용을 그대로 인용하면\n  서버가 그래프 대조로 실제 노드 id 로 승격(resolve_content_refs). 불일치는 기각.\n\n수정\n- legacy_provenance: envelope 이 중첩 도착하는 실측 케이스에서 1회만 벗겨\n  상세 검토가 전량 파싱 실패하던 결함 → 고정점 unwrap. code_text 저장 상한 추가.\n- staged_consolidate: 스테이지 산출물을 diff 로 재구성하며 근거를 버리던 결함 →\n  `_refs()` 합집합 운반. Command/Event 는 {name, legacyRefs} 객체형도 수용.\n- oda_runner: 저장 경로가 근거 관문을 지나지 않던 누락 → 배선.\n\nUI\n- LegacyTag(3상태: 연결 N / 근거 없음 / 근거 미기록) + 우측 고정 근거 인스펙터\n  (클릭=핀, hover=내용 교체). 근거 문장 → 원문 코드(줄번호) → 역방향 인용 요소.\n- 제안 헤더에 커버리지 스트립과 \"근거 검증\" 토글(전체 판정·연결선 전개).\n- 프론트의 문자열 substring 매칭 제거 — 연결의 진실은 요소가 소유한 근거뿐.\n\n경로 정리\n- 역추출(REVERSE_INTENT) 경로 전체 삭제(라우트·서비스·프론트·i18n·enum).\n  DB 실측상 해당 모드 제안 0건, 모드 파싱은 SIMPLIFIED 폴백으로 이중 안전.\n- 남은 3경로(간소화·상세 DDD·ODA) 스킬에 동일 근거 계약 적용.\n\n검증(실측)\n- 게이트 7/7: 계약형 제안 7건, linked 근거 143건 전건 그래프 해석·소스라인 일치,\n  관찰집합 밖 근거 0, 구버전 unknown 유지.\n- 실생성 E2E: 간소화 6건 + 상세 DDD 1건(요소 32 중 30 연결, 규칙 승격 3).\n  실행 중 미검토 노드 인용이 관문에 차단되는 것을 실측.\n- pytest 113(proposal_lifecycle) / 전체 회귀 신규 실패 0 / 프론트 unit 10 /\n  UI 스위트 32.\n- 미검증: ODA 실생성 — 표준 지식베이스($ODA_KNOWLEDGE_ROOT) 부재 환경.\n  저장 관문은 단위 테스트로 잠금.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b2e74e0b89d9c2fbc24ac54e7d3a1e47fdae902","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/3b2e74e0b89d9c2fbc24ac54e7d3a1e47fdae902"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/651ce0fec6c9a2ee82985105fd67fde4a4e52cbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/651ce0fec6c9a2ee82985105fd67fde4a4e52cbc","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKDY1MWNlMGZlYzZjOWEyZWU4Mjk4NTEwNWZkNjdmZGU0YTRlNTJjYmM","pa