.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/d9688409f51a73fa90e56d2bf64a5b8e8c368e3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T00:40:18Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T00:40:18Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"@\nfix(skill-runner): Windows claude.CMD shim hang 근본수정 — claude.exe 직접 스폰\n\n증상: 인텐트/스킬 스폰 시 claude 가 stdout 0바이트로 무한 대기(INTENT_FAILED).\n원인(관문 추적 확정): shutil.which(\"claude\")=npm claude.CMD → cmd.exe 경유 →\nclaude.exe %*. 이 cmd.exe 중간 계층이 스트리밍 stdout 파이프를 자식에게 안 이어줘\nsubprocess 가 출력을 못 받고 hang. --version(즉시종료)은 되고 -p(스트리밍)만 막힘.\nclaude.exe 직접 스폰 시 1.3초 정상 출력 실측.\n\n수정: _resolve_claude_bin() 이 .cmd/.bat/.ps1 shim 을 실제 claude.exe 로 해소.\n추가: 무인 스폰이므로 stdin=DEVNULL(상속 터미널 stdin 대기 방지, 방어적).\n\n검증: PRO-001 인텐트 E2E 완주 — stream-json 정상·cluster_retrieve 5회 호출(레거시\n참조 작동)·strategicDiff(Epic3/Feature3/US4/Process1) 생성·SSE strategic_diff→done.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n@","tree":{"sha":"076492429cf2a48a6c4fe4955f7cd6b96f4768d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/076492429cf2a48a6c4fe4955f7cd6b96f4768d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/d9688409f51a73fa90e56d2bf64a5b8e8c368e3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followe