.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/e852180a9bd0ac26dfaa32f2a7fe6de9fa52a0ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T04:48:28Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T04:48:28Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"feat(proposals): 역추출 UI 재설계 — 사실 기반·헤더 정리·간격 카드\n\n사용자 피드백 반영(가독성·클러터 제거):\n- 헤더: 제목=DB명, 부제=실제 데이터 수(그룹·작업·규칙). \"코드 역추출/분석 그래프\"\n  문구 제거. 역추출 모드에선 작성자·생성일 줄 숨김(코드 그래프라 무의미)\n- 그룹 라벨: 애매한 \"핵심 데이터/일괄처리\" 배지 제거 → 사실만(테이블명·쓰기/조회·\n  작업/규칙 수). \"기타(테이블 연결 없음)\"은 기본 해제\n- ReverseIntentTrack: 간격 카드 스타일(여백으로 답답함 해소)·작업 접기/펼치기·\n  그리드 정렬(지그재그 0)·테마 토큰·focus-visible\n\n검증: Playwright 상호작용 전수 통과(생성·모드스왑·소스선택·부분선택·전체선택/해제·\n0개 비활성·펼치기·탭전환, LLM 실행만 제외), 전체화면 실물 캡처 확인.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"876686fd0f6d276faa65dd593a47d69d813ebb99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/876686fd0f6d276faa65dd593a47d69d813ebb99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/e852180a9bd0ac26dfaa32f2a7fe6de9fa52a0ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon8