/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/166f8a0dff5ccd64aba401b6c900b630998c65b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:26:31Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:26:31Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"feat(proposals): 역추출에 데이터 그룹 부분 선택 추가 (spec 047 개정)\n\n\"DB 전체 자동\" → 사용자가 그룹을 골라 실행하도록 정정(실제 의도).\n\n- 백엔드: preview_groups + GET /{id}/reverse/groups(LLM 없는 선택용 미리보기),\n  스트림 ?groups= 선택 필터(stream_reverse(db, selected))\n- 프론트: fetchReverseGroups + subscribeToReverseIntent(id, selectedKeys),\n  ReverseIntentTrack 선택 체크박스 카드(기본 전체·전체선택/해제·0개 실행불가)\n- UI 지침 준수: 그리드 고정정렬(지그재그 0)·테마 토큰 색·focus-visible·\n  reduced-motion·해제 카드 흐림 상태표시\n- 스펙/plan 문서 개정 + UI 품질 NFR(NFR-UI-1~5) 명문화\n\n실측: preview_groups(test)=5그룹, Playwright로 전체선택(5/5)·부분선택(4/5)\n화면 캡처 확인, 프론트 build OK. \"역추출 실행\"(LLM)은 미클릭.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"71f101204cf6ecb9ffe1d2fd48724a0358b5ba32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/71f101204cf6ecb9ffe1d2fd48724a0358b5ba32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/166f8a0dff5ccd64aba401b6c900b630998c65b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https:/