rl":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/720e611068c0f19613ec25240133797ad34b5ed7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T02:59:25Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T02:59:25Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"feat(proposals): 코드 분석 그래프에서 요구사항 역추출 모드(REVERSE_INTENT) 추가 (spec 047)\n\n문서 없이 analyzer 코드 그래프만으로 요구사항(Strategic Diff)을 역추출하는\n새 Proposal 진입 모드. 검증된 PoC(reverse-intent-poc) 이식.\n\n- 결정론 코어(services/reverse_intent/): 테이블 앵커 그룹핑·무손실 브리프·\n  예산분할·테이블 병합·자연어 라벨(logical_name+성격 한국어) — LLM 0\n- 요구사항 도출은 기존 robo-proposal-intent 스킬 재사용(_build_reverse_prompt)\n- 분석 그래프 목록 자동조회(SHOW DATABASES + 오퍼레이션 프로브)\n- analyzer 그래프는 읽기 전용, 결과는 기존 strategicDiff 속성 → 하류 무변경 재사용\n- UI: ProposalCreate 종류 라디오 +1 + 소스 드롭다운, ReverseIntentTrack(그룹 카드)\n- SDD 산출물 전체(spec/plan/research/data-model/contracts/quickstart/tasks)\n\n실측 검증: 소스 자동식별(neo4j/skill/test), test DB 그룹핑 커버리지100%·중복0,\n읽는 카드 렌더, 프론트 빌드 OK, UI 선택화면 Playwright 확인.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"184f3ad501f999c3a1d93c73cc5ef2c28a550052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/184f3ad501f999c3a1d93c73cc5ef2c28a550052"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/720e611068c0f19613ec25240133797ad34b5ed7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","g