ved_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/0d82729db12069b337ea910d40f003e3e7d30732","node_id":"C_kwDOQ1ErydoAKDBkODI3MjlkYjEyMDY5YjMzN2VhOTEwZDQwZjAwM2UzZTdkMzA3MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commit/eb04afb08ba9cd2ef2cbd71993e7c87f87b15291","sha":"eb04afb08ba9cd2ef2cbd71993e7c87f87b15291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/eb04afb08ba9cd2ef2cbd71993e7c87f87b15291"}],"sha":"0d82729db12069b337ea910d40f003e3e7d30732","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/0d82729db12069b337ea910d40f003e3e7d30732"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"login":"ahnchiyoon87","node_id":"U_kgDOCeNVpA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/commits/bf71ca5abc4975da4ee5cc4370d45272b6f571ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T20:03:17Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T20:03:17Z","email":"ahnpybara@uengine.org","name":"ahnchiyoon87"},"message":"docs(045): Task↔Rule 매핑이 GPU(SGLang) 임베딩에서 동작 안 함 — 조사기록, 045 코드 롤백\n\n코드분석 하이브리드 Phase3(전체탐색) Task↔Rule 매핑이 사내 GPU(SGLang)\n임베딩 서버에서 무너짐(0건/과소매핑).\n\n근본(강한 가설): 매칭이 의존하는 임베딩이 SGLang(1024d)에서 한국어 업무\n텍스트를 변별 못 함(task↔rule 변별 측정 1/19, 모든 task 동일 top). 매칭\n문턱값(process 게이트 0.55 / per-module floor 0.45)이 변별 잘 되는 임베딩\n(데모는 아마 진짜 OpenAI) 기준으로 튜닝돼 있어 SGLang에선 깨짐. 결정론\n어휘(TF-IDF char n-gram)로는 변별 8/19로 작동 → 신호 문제임이 확정적.\n\n045(컨테이너→개별 Rule 단위 전환)는 그 약한 임베딩의 우회 시도였고, 5개\n변경(게이트제거·프리필터제거·blob변경·dead제거·청킹) 전부 임베딩-의존이라\n독립적으로 불필요 → git 롤백(데모매칭 + 044 그래프계약 상태로 복귀). 본\nspec/research/tasks 는 조사 기록으로만 보존.\n\n다음: 진짜 OpenAI 임베딩(text-embedding-3-small)으로 변별 측정해 가설\n확정 → 맞으면 임베딩 엔드포인트만 교정하면 데모처럼 동작(코드변경 0).\n044(그래프계약 적응 + dbms/framework 통일=owner_resolver)는 유효·무관.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1aebc6278caf4946f71ab6772320718689567c02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/1aebc6278caf4946f71ab6772320718689567c02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/bf71ca5abc4975da4ee5cc4370d45272b6f571ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/165893540?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ahnchiyoon87/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ahnchiyoon87","id":165893540,"log