d,\n  apply_waiver, ensure_can_proceed) — REUSE/EXTEND/NEW, comply-then-extend\n- oda_runner.py: 지식 루트 해석 + 스킬 결과 파서 + intent/plan SSE(표준 diff 수렴)\n- proposals_oda.py 라우트(stream/oda/intent·plan, oda/conformance, oda/waive) + router\n- submit/plan 게이트 강제: FAIL+미면제면 409\n\n스킬: skills/robo-proposals/robo-proposal-oda (extends oda-specify/oda-plan)\n\n프런트:\n- ProposalCreate 세 번째 모드 옵션 + detail 위임\n- OdaStandardTrack.vue(정합성 매핑·게이트·면제·산출물) + ProposalDetail 분기\n- store subscribeToOda/stopOda/waiveConformance + i18n(ko/en)\n\n테스트: test_oda_standard.py 29개 pass, 기존 042 무회귀(전체 60 pass/1 skip);\n프런트 빌드 통과, 앱 부팅 + ODA 라우트 등록 확인. 매뉴얼 manual.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"abee26f7f08f8cdd21d580716ea588b6211c5897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/trees/abee26f7f08f8cdd21d580716ea588b6211c5897"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uengine-oss/robo-architect/git/commits/1a16c9c1caffd83d7c9cc95c7bae87a7e033c5ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/487999?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jinyoung","id":487999,"login":"jinyoung","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4Nzk5OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jinyoung/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gi